{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51097","headline":"七言记德诗三十首谨献司徒相公 陈情 · 崔致远","name":"七言记德诗三十首谨献司徒相公 陈情","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"俗眼难窥冰雪姿，终朝共咏小山词。\n此身依托同鷄犬，他日昇天莫弃遗。\n（按以上三十首诗见《桂苑笔耕集》第十七卷，前有《献诗啓》，畧谓：「如某者，迹自外方，艺唯下品。\n虽儒宫慕善，每尝窥颜冉之墙，而笔阵争雄，未得摩曹刘之垒。\n但以幸游乐国，获覩仁风，久贮恳诚，冀伸歌咏，辄献纪德绝句诗三十首，谨封如别。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51097.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51097","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}